BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:998037
DTSTAMP:20261016T215531Z
DTSTART:20261016T233000Z
DTEND:20261017T014500Z
SUMMARY:Two Strangers (Carry a Cake Across New York)
LOCATION:Longacre Theatre, 220 West 48th Street, New York NY 10036
DESCRIPTION:<p><em>Two Strangers (Carry a Cake Across New York) </em>is an
  uncommonly surprising musical about finding common ground. Tony Award&reg;
  nominees Sam Tutty and Christiani Pitts star as Dougal and Robin, an
  unlikely pair who spend three life-changing days together in NYC. With a
  score of instant classics and a story that&rsquo;s equally hilarious and
  heartfelt, <em>Two Strangers</em> is a completely original musical that
  &ldquo;achieves something magical&rdquo; (<em>Vulture</em>).<br /><br
  />&ldquo;A must-see! The feel-good musical of the season.&rdquo; &mdash;
  <em>Cosmopolitan</em><br /><br />"A big, original hit!" &mdash;
  <em>Vogue</em><br /><br />&ldquo;A Broadway hit! Laugh-out-loud
  funny.&rdquo; &mdash; <em>Variety</em></p>
END:VEVENT
